Professional Status WorkflowFor a juice business, I recommend using these standard statuses to keep your orders organized:
Current Status           Meaning                        Action Needed
Pending                  Order just placed.             Kitchen needs to see it.
Processing               Juice is being made.           Staff is working on it.
Shipped/Out for Delivery Driver has the juice.          Customer is waiting.
Completed                Cash received/Juice delivered. Archive the order.Cancelled                Customer changed mind.         Refund or restock.

